# itel RS4 (S666LN) -> AICP w16.2 build recipe. The repo is the RECIPE: local_manifests/,
# sync.sh, apply-overlays.sh, the build scripts, tools/, README. Everything proprietary,
# huge, secret or personal stays local (same rules as ~/itel_rs4_Crdroid).

# Private signing keys -- NEVER commit
keys-priv/
*.pk8
*.x509.pem

# Built ROM zips and logs
out-zips/
logs/
*.zip
*.log

# Proprietary stock firmware / blobs (the vendor tree is generated from stock rev 28 elsewhere)
*.stockfw.zip
blobs*/

# Editor / script backups
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.swp
*~
